WEBVTT

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:36.930
<i>ENTER THE RED DOORS</i>

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:57.530
<i>Up above the forest of slumber</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:04.160
<i>Two moons look down from the sky</i>

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:11.670
<i>Where did you come from,</i>
<i>and where are you going?</i>

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:20.050
<i>Where are we going?</i>

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:25.730
<i>ENTER THE RED DOORS</i>

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:53.710
You know this song?

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:59.590
You said that there was
a witch protecting Eve.

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:01.350
Have you ever met her?

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:04.600
Yeah. How many have there been now?

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:08.270
There are some conditions
to being a witch protecting Eve.

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:08.940
Like what?

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:11.660
Being a virgin, full of innocence.

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:16.150
So, why a lily?

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:20.530
Because white lilies represent virtue.

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:25.690
These also go by the name "Madonna lily."

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:34.040
"Lily"...? Well, whatever.
What sort of witch is this next one?

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:38.510
"The Witch Wars"

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:42.680
Surprised?

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:44.720
Surprised.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:47.350
Hello, Professor.

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:49.560
Way to get everyone together.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:52.520
They said that after they woke up,

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:55.190
they all started keeping
in contact with each other.

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:58.900
They seemed to know that
they were all former witches.

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:02.310
We all have the same wish.

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:05.060
We'd like to see Haruto.

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:09.830
We've all started looking around
us to see where Haruto is

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:12.580
and how he's doing in the real world.

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:14.210
You, too?

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:16.050
I'd appreciate it if you didn't underestimate

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:17.920
the Valanga royal intelligence network.

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:22.800
Professor, have you found any
leads on Haruto on your end?

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:23.830
No.

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:29.910
When we were witches, we sensed that
Haruto was different from the others.

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:31.730
Different from the others?

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:33.270
As far as time goes.

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:34.210
Time?

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:39.280
The time that envelops Haruto
is different than our own.

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:41.530
Than yours as well, of course.

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:45.070
Hmm? It's not like<i> I</i>
understand what it means.

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:49.080
Right now, everyone is
splitting up to look for clues

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.750
based on what we felt before.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:54.790
So you're saying that
your feelings are a lead?

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.040
Yes.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:58.300
It seems like such an
imprecise thing to go on.

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:02.720
People who have been in the
dream world have a different aura.

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:04.970
You know how they say that
celebrities project an aura?

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:07.170
You really can tell just by looking at them.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:09.180
What does it look like?

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:11.680
There's a little bit of a glow around them.

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:14.310
First I've heard of this.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:17.190
An unexpected effect of
Sleeping Beauty Syndrome, eh?

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:21.990
Another red door?

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:25.570
What lies ahead is a witch's world.

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:28.910
What's that?

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:29.910
I don't know.

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:31.490
Does it have something to do with Eve?

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.310
Maybe it does, but I have no idea.

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:37.710
This sounds like a job for...

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:40.710
The professor? But you two were fighting.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.820
Are you saying we can never
speak to each other again?

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:46.570
I'm not such a petty man as that.

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:50.970
Haruto!

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:54.390
Got it. I'll be right there.

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:55.850
Has something happened to Haruto?

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:57.100
I have to go.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:00.770
You can communicate with
the dream world through that.

00:05:00.770 --> 00:05:04.610
If you learn anything about Haruto,
let me know. I'm counting on you.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:12.370
Goddess Eve, I can feel your power!

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:15.910
Your monumentally noble
and beautiful power!

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:17.290
Your awakening is nigh.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:22.460
May you awaken as soon
as possible, to save the world!

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:25.170
How is the former witches' search going?

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.890
No major developments at the moment.

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:33.220
Then again, the only leads we're
working from are our feelings.

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:36.730
I'd like to meet Haruto
Tsukishiro myself someday.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:40.190
That's the only hope that
keeps us looking, as well.

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:46.250
To speak to a tangible Haruto,
not in the dream world, but in reality.

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:48.730
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.740
I apologize for before.

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:57.040
What's the matter?

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:00.670
That voice--or rather, that song...

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:02.340
Does it ring any bells?

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:03.340
It's my sister.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:04.630
--Huh?
--Really?

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:08.220
Is she on the other side of this door?

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.020
Your sister's voice?

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:11.930
What do you think, Lily?

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:13.330
Lily is here?!

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:21.730
She's here!

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:24.270
I've been here the whole time, actually.

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:28.020
This is the crest of the
Thorn Cross Association.

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.740
They venerate the goddess Eve--

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:31.950
Again with Eve.

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.910
You know about Eve?

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:36.000
I know her best of all.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:39.630
The emblem that the professor
mentioned must be this one.

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:41.630
What is it?

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:44.250
I know it. The Thorn Cross Association.

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:46.880
They're pleading all over
the world for Eve to awaken.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:49.510
I'm worried about his sister.

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:51.550
Would someone please come with me?

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:53.600
To the professor's laboratory?

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:58.350
Yes. If his sister experiences
any changes while he isn't around,

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:00.020
we'll need to inform him.

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:03.310
Okay, I'll go.

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:07.570
You girls keep an eye on the place, okay?

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:10.150
If what Lily says is true...

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:14.870
It <i>is</i> true! What the Thorn Cross Association
says is the exact opposite.

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:16.160
We'll find out once we meet Eve.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.580
Meet her, and then what?

00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:19.830
She's not like the other witches up to now.

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:22.620
Everyone dies once she wakes up, right?

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:24.590
We kill her.

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:26.780
I had a hunch it would come to that.

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:28.340
How would we do that?

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:33.800
Only Brother can do it--
kill Eve. If he doesn't,

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:35.680
we all die.

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:37.780
Please.

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:42.310
I'll consider it after we meet her.

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:09.550
That's intimidating. What is that?

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:12.130
We won't get anywhere unarmed.
We need some weapons.

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:13.950
Where are we going to find them?

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:15.590
If this is a dream, we ought to be
able to come up with something.

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:17.050
We're not coming up with <i>anything</i>!

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:26.410
There is some sort of activity
in the dream world where gods dwell!

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:35.100
On your knees, intruders.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:38.500
I will permit you to look upon me.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.330
She's the witch in here?

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:45.460
I can't see the witch's thoughts.
There are just these cannons.

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:47.670
They weren't created
from the witch's thoughts.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:49.980
That's not the issue.

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:51.840
That's my sister.

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:58.970
I am the Witch of White Lilies.
I guard Eve's door with my virtue.

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:00.750
What are you talking about?

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:04.980
Yurina, it's me! It's your brother!

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:26.480
The witch doesn't recognize
you as her brother.

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:32.380
I see. You want to get rid of me, Eve.

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:33.050
What?

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:36.050
The witch is being controlled by Eve.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.590
That's why I can't see the witch's thoughts.

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:42.810
This isn't a dream world created
by the witch. It's Eve's world.

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:47.420
Why did you suddenly stop?

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:51.400
A hospital?

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:54.650
I've gone in there many
times since the incident.

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:59.160
Why? What do you need?

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:02.310
It's been a while, so I'm going
to pay my respects to the doctor.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:05.840
Huh? What is this?
We're getting sidetracked!

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.380
Doctor...

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:12.210
Ah, it's you.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:14.340
Is this your friend?

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:17.090
I'm Airi Kojima. Nice to meet you.

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:17.880
Huh?

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.970
Wow, your doctor is super-fine!

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:25.980
That's terrific. I'm relieved
to see you're with a friend.

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:29.270
That's right! I'm her friend!

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:33.800
We were in the area, so she said
she should come say hello to her doctor...

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:37.840
Was that...?

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:39.240
Yeah.

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:44.580
Ah, that patient? He's been
in a coma for a long time.

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:48.000
He hasn't woken up once since
he was brought in here.

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:49.870
Did you feel it?

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:53.000
Yeah. Just like it felt in my dream.

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:03.600
Shake it off, Lily!

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:06.850
I'm okay... I'm okay...

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:10.770
That witch! It's not right to be
shooting at a child like this.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:14.520
All the same, she's still my sister.

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:20.530
"Haruto Tsukishiro"

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:22.450
Haruto Tsukishiro.

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:23.660
Yeah.

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:24.950
We finally found him.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:25.870
Hold on.

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:29.500
There's a chance it's someone
who has the same name.

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:32.750
But you felt it, right?
The sensation from that world?

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:34.040
We have to make sure.

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:35.410
How do we do that?

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:49.930
Yurina!

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:52.330
I thought I understood you.

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:56.980
You didn't want to be an idol, right?

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:58.480
Huh? An idol?

00:11:58.650 --> 00:11:59.650
Indeed.

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:03.820
Yurina successfully passed an audition
her friend signed her up for

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:05.200
and became an idol.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:07.990
She had so many people cheering for her

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:10.940
that she wore herself out trying
to meet their expectations.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:14.210
I don't think that you
were trying to escape

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:16.130
by developing Sleeping Beauty Syndrome.

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.800
Your sense of duty, which
compelled you to keep working,

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:21.800
is what drove you,
and then brought you to a halt.

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:25.140
Yurina! Wake up!

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:26.820
Enough, already!

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:30.720
Having Sleeping Beauty Syndrome
is the same as being dead! But you're alive!

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:33.810
As long as you're alive,
you can choose a different life!

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:39.530
Professor K!

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:41.650
"For real?!"
"Mana says we should make sure"
 "We certainly need to do that"
 "How do we make sure?"

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:43.740
That's a good question.

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:45.950
We have to come out and ask, don't we?

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.160
All right.

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:49.280
What's the matter?

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:51.290
"Would you like my help?"

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:53.000
Who's Kayo?

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:55.120
Kayo was the Witch of First Love.

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:57.130
The Witch of First Love?

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:59.590
She's the one who passed away, right?

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.590
She might not be able to come here,

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:04.430
but she may have left part
of her soul in this world,

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:05.880
out of concern for Haruto.

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:09.300
Amazing! A text message from a dead person!

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:10.850
I'll try to answer her.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:13.640
"Kayo, help us"

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:14.980
"Just a moment.
I'll be right back."

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:14.980
Incredible!

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:17.690
You're kidding. A dead person?

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:20.650
She's already here.

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:23.360
We can see her.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:25.020
We sure can, huh?

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:35.290
Stop this, witch!

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:42.630
What is it? I'm busy right now.

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:45.420
We found out where Haruto is.

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:47.430
"It's Haruto.
No doubt about it."

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:52.930
Huh? What was that?

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:56.690
I said, we found out where Haruto is!

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:02.090
What's that sound? It's super loud.

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:11.280
I'm sorry, Yuko, but I can't chat right now.

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:18.620
This world is collapsing.

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:19.630
It's what?

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:22.380
It's being wiped out, witch and all.

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:25.760
I recognize this voice.

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:27.220
Do you know who it is?

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:30.220
It's Yureena's voice! The idol
that other idols want to be!

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:31.720
Can you go save her?

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:33.140
I'd like to.

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:36.100
You're a witch, right?
All you have to do is dream.

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:37.980
In other words, just go to sleep.

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:47.570
Who are you?!

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:55.290
What are you...?

00:14:55.700 --> 00:15:00.290
Haruto, an eye for an eye,
and an idol for an idol!

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:04.000
I don't really follow, and I'm
not sure if I'm convinced or not.

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:07.760
Yureena is who I always wanted to be!

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:08.970
Perish!

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:18.730
There's only so much that
Misaki can do by herself!

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:20.560
What Eve seeks is purity.

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.810
So if we sully that purity,

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:25.980
Eve won't have any need
of that witch anymore.

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:27.690
Easier said than done.

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.030
Away with you!

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:31.030
Yureena, <i>you're</i> the one
who needs to wake up!

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:35.870
I won't let anyone, not even a witch,
disturb the goddess's sleep!

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:42.330
You told me to kill Eve, right?

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:43.140
Yes.

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:45.500
I thought of how to kill her.

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:46.380
Huh?

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:50.380
I was thinking of doing it like this...

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:04.270
Lily, get lost!

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.610
You did it, Haruto.

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:15.570
Eve is watching me through you, right?

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:16.370
Let me go!

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:17.510
Not happening.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:22.960
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:31.880
I've despoiled your white lily.

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:36.220
Hi there.

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:39.100
Haruto! Why, you...!

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:42.430
No! What-- What have you done?

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:44.000
Eve has left her.

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:47.020
What do you think I did?

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:49.050
Don't go spiking the ball!

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:52.360
How can you be so brazenly 
rude in front of me?!

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:54.530
You're going to answer for what you did!

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:59.280
Ow! Ow! What do you mean,
"answer" for it? Ow! Ow!

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:01.200
Big Brother, stop!

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:02.040
Huh? You're...

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:04.670
Huh. Even as a cat, she could tell.

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:07.510
Yurina! You're back to your old self?!

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:09.380
That should do it.

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:10.050
What?

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:14.840
For an idol, this could be a
life-shattering scandal, after all.

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:17.090
You little--! H-How did you get that?!

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:19.510
It's a dream, you know.
Anything can happen.

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:22.770
Don't you sell that!
Don't you sell that to anyone!

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:29.270
Professor K is definitely
an older brother, all right.

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:32.320
Yureena, let's sing together.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:33.110
Huh?

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:34.400
We're going to destroy that.

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:37.490
Wh-What's going on?

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:40.660
An evil goddess is on the
other side of that fort.

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:42.750
That's right. Sing.

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:44.500
Who are you?

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:46.870
I'm a fan of yours.

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:48.000
A fan?

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:58.550
Now what?!

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:09.060
Yurina, sing!

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:10.360
We'll all be wiped out otherwise.

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:13.690
If I sing, everyone will be saved?

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:15.190
You'll be saved, too.

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:42.040
You've grown stronger, huh, Misaki?

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:58.860
Awesome...

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:22.720
You're enjoying this.

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:24.010
Well, this <i>is</i> a dream.

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:41.260
That door... It's the same door
that you always use, isn't it?

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:46.740
I want you to take Yurina out of here.

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:47.660
Right.

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:50.290
Make sure not to let Eve
mess with you ever again.

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:51.830
Catch you later, Big Brother.

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:56.340
"Catch you later"?! Come on,
don't you care at all that he kissed you?!

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:59.550
How stale. You're giving off
an old fogey vibe.

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:01.880
Sh-She's taking it lightly! <i>Too</i> lightly!

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:20.780
You're awake.

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:22.530
Who are you?

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:26.830
Someone who was saved
by the man you just met.

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:33.080
I'm going to let everyone see Haruto now.

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:49.310
Is that... Haruto?

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:51.850
What has happened to Haruto?

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:57.020
Did you see that?

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:57.950
Yes.

00:20:58.360 --> 00:20:59.690
What does it mean?

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:01.650
How long has he been asleep?

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:08.780
Eve is asleep on the
other side of that door?

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:10.410
She's awake now.

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:11.500
What?

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:12.960
Eve is awake?

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:27.640
Hearken, people! The goddess
Eve has just awakened!

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:30.010
The time of our salvation is at hand!

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:39.060
It's the beginning of the end.

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:46.490
Time to meet the goddess.

00:23:28.010 --> 00:23:30.340
The dream... ends.

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:32.310
It ends, baa.

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:36.150
Next time's dream is "Eve's Sigh."

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:41.410
"Eve's Sigh"
